collie-files — attribution

Source: Herdr's shipped `files` mod, the `files` folder under herdr-app's `mods/`
(herdr-app is the platform, not Shepherdr). `main.js` and `mod.json` are ported
from that mod: the folder tree, lazy directory loading, git status letters,
bounded read-only preview, back-to-list, watchFolder and machine (`on`) support.
Upstream quoted its own icons as "mods/" + the mod's name; here they are drawn
from this mod's folder instead. Collie adds a Code/Preview switch and a
Markdown preview (`preview.js` plus the `TextView.markdown` branch in
`main.js`); the rest of `main.js` is upstream, and `mod.json` is
`{ "place": "none" }` as upstream.

The preview's front matter handling follows herdr's `markdown-panel` mod
(Apache-2.0, by jlopezlira and h0ru5).

Icons `chevron-down.svg`, `chevron-right.svg`, `file.svg`, `folder.svg` are
Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), ISC License, Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons
and Contributors. The full Lucide/Feather notice ships with herdr-app as
`icons/LICENSE-Lucide.txt`.
